=== Shop Purchase ===
Players can also obtain '''Glowstone Dust''' by buying {{Item|Glowstone}} from {{NPCSprite|Builder}}, placing it and breaking it on the {{zone|Private Island}}. While this doesn't give collection, it can help players on {{Gamemode|Bingo}} to obtain {{Item|Magical Mushroom Soup}}, or upgrade potions.

=== Minions ===
'''Glowstone Dust''' can be produced by [[Glowstone Minion]], or [[Inferno Minion]] with [[Inferno Minion Fuel]].

== Usage ==
=== Brewing ===
[[Brewing|Brewing]] [[Potions]] with '''Glowstone Dust''' amplifies a potion's level by {{Green|1}}.

